erpillar has 1.6 million connected assets. Deere=E2=80=99s CFO says the agi=
ng fleet=0Ais already flagging replacement demand under soft orders. The in=
stalled base is=0Abecoming the forecast.=0A=C2=A0=E2=80=8C=C2=A0=E2=80=8C=
